  "subject": {
    "id": "cc001-sphinx-import-boundary-correction",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Correct the Sphinx execution and public-example RED boundary.",
  "why": "Pinned Sphinx 8.1.3 requires an empty string, not boolean false, to disable implicit doctest blocks without a fatal type warning. The operator-selected twelve guides also already use seven shipped package-root symbols. This corrected RED freezes those seven exact example imports while keeping autodoc and autosummary limited to malleus and malleus.OntologyRegistry; future exports do not self-authorize."
}
